<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/morphoeval-delphi10000-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Arabidopsis thaliana Turing wavenumber at 111.6 µm (Arabidopsis thaliana)",
        "Arabidopsis thaliana Turing wavenumber at 111.6 µm faithfully reproduces Arabidopsis thaliana morphology" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/delphi10000-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/delphi10000-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/delphi10000-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0-3> ;
    dct:description "The simulation script(s) models/2026-delphi10000-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Arabidopsis thaliana specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is carried by the MorphoEval rubric assessments." ;
    dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/main/models/2026-delphi10000-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0.py> ;
    schema:about "Arabidopsis thaliana" ;
    schema:additionalProperty "does_not_claim: The Boutet epidermis micrograph has no scale bar, so its Fourier peak is not a micrometre measurement.",
        "does_not_claim: The model is not the full Balkunde gene network and not the Di Patti birth-death master equation.",
        "does_not_claim: The three branches of the Paves trichome are not a prediction of the PDE.",
        "does_not_claim: datasets/species_gallery Arabidopsis_thaliana.jpg is Aeonium tabuliforme and is not a specimen for this loop.",
        "reconstructed_in_script: Additive noise run used only to compare high-k tail weight.",
        "reconstructed_in_script: Periodic 446.4 µm patch, 128² spectral IMEX integrator, seed 3117.",
        "reconstructed_in_script: Two-component Schnakenberg kinetics with a=0.05, b=1, Dv/Du=8.4, λ_c=111.6 µm.",
        "reported_in_source: Balkunde 2020 constrains an activator-inhibitor plus activator-depletion network with weak ttg1 alleles.",
        "reported_in_source: Bouyer 2008 shows TTG1 is trapped by GL3 and depleted around trichomes.",
        "reported_in_source: Di Patti 2023 reports fat-tailed trichome power spectra.",
        "reported_in_source: Turing 1952 gives k_c from the determinant of J - k^2 D.",
        "transfer_boundary: Integer Lean witnesses use the sign pattern of the Jacobian, not the floating-point entries.",
        "transfer_boundary: The catalog wavelength 111.6 µm is the assigned scale of this slot. It is not a spacing printed in Bouyer 2008 or Di Patti 2023." ;
    pk:context "script(s): https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/main/models/2026-delphi10000-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0.py; output: docs/media/arabidopsis_thaliana_turing_wavelength_s0_comparison.png; organism: Arabidopsis thaliana; environment: python 3.12.3, numpy 2.5.4, scipy 1.18.1, matplotlib 3.11.2, Pillow 13.0.0; claim_boundary: [reported_in_source: Turing 1952 gives k_c from the determinant of J - k^2 D. | Bouyer 2008 shows TTG1 is trapped by GL3 and depleted around trichomes. | Di Patti 2023 reports fat-tailed trichome power spectra. | Balkunde 2020 constrains an activator-inhibitor plus activator-depletion network with weak ttg1 alleles.; reconstructed_in_script: Two-component Schnakenberg kinetics with a=0.05, b=1, Dv/Du=8.4, λ_c=111.6 µm. | Periodic 446.4 µm patch, 128² spectral IMEX integrator, seed 3117. | Additive noise run used only to compare high-k tail weight.; transfer_boundary: The catalog wavelength 111.6 µm is the assigned scale of this slot. It is not a spacing printed in Bouyer 2008 or Di Patti 2023. | Integer Lean witnesses use the sign pattern of the Jacobian, not the floating-point entries.; does_not_claim: The three branches of the Paves trichome are not a prediction of the PDE. | The model is not the full Balkunde gene network and not the Di Patti birth-death master equation. | The Boutet epidermis micrograph has no scale bar, so its Fourier peak is not a micrometre measurement. | datasets/species_gallery Arabidopsis_thaliana.jpg is Aeonium tabuliforme and is not a specimen for this loop.]; phenomenon_size: 2.7 cm (0.027 m, log10=-1.569 m, tier=7_organism_cm); species_scale_ladder (6 runs from 2.7 cm to 4.8 cm): 2.7 cm:microtubule-stress-meristem, 3.2 cm:auxin-pin1-meristem, 3.5 cm:pavement-cell-lobing, 4.0 cm:carrier-driven-canalization, 4.3 cm:meristem-phyllotaxis-pin, 4.8 cm:root-auxin-reflux-fountain" ;
    pk:derivedFromPaper <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.celrep.2020.108497>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.2309616120>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1098/rstb.1952.0012>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pbio.0060141> ;
    pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0-overall>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0-parameter-expressivity>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0-repro-package>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0-source-traceability>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0-specimen-match> ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-27-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0-audit-delphi10000-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-27-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0-audit-delphi10000-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0-10>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-27-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0-audit-delphi10000-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0-11>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-27-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0-audit-delphi10000-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0-12>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-27-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0-audit-delphi10000-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-27-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0-audit-delphi10000-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0-3>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-27-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0-audit-delphi10000-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0-4>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-27-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0-audit-delphi10000-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0-5>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-27-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0-audit-delphi10000-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0-6>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-27-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0-audit-delphi10000-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0-7>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-27-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0-audit-delphi10000-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0-8>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-27-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0-audit-delphi10000-arabidopsis-thaliana-turing-wavelength-s0-9> ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Turing Reaction-Diffusion Wavelength Selection" ;
    pk:weightOfEvidence 8.54e-01 .

